				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "一个堆叠队列"
			x: -5.75d
			y: -5.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7现在，要将物品添加到你的 Sylladex 中，请在快捷栏中选择它们并按 V。物品会消失并被放入你 Captchalogue Deck 中的一张空白卡牌中！"
				""
				"&7用一块原石试试吧。通常可以合成一整组，但并非总是如此。"
				""
				"&7现在，将物品放入你的Sylladex很简单。取出物品则...有些不同。开始时，你的Sylladex处于“队列”模式。你可以通过查看Sylladex的右上角来确认当前模式。"
				""
				"&7In Queue mode, items are added to the left side of of the Sylladex. Each new item pushes the previous items to the right, creating an orderly line."
				""
				"&7In \"Queue\" mode, you can only remove the RIGHT most item. If you Left Click the item, you pull it out of the Card and into your inventory. If you RIGHT Click, you remove the card WITH the item! Do that now, you'll need that soon."
			]
