		{
			title: "圆润多彩"
			x: -5.75d
			y: -4.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7把那个Cruxtruder放在某个地方，你会经常用到。它顶部有个盖子，白色的，上面有绿色的符号。用镐子之类的东西把它敲掉。"
				""
				"&7Cruxtruder 用于将原始 Cruxite 塑造成更适合炼金术使用的形态。右键点击 Cruxite 并将其放入“管道”中即可填充 Cruxtruder。"
				""
				"&7然后右键点击管道侧面的深灰色轮子，即可“挤出”一根Cruxite Dowel。"
				""
				"&7Think of the Cruxite Dowel like an Iron Ingot. Except its the color you chose when you first woke up in the FOPGame Server. And I think this is the only place that color actually shows up.... huh."
			]
			dependencies: ["52754C14A4625112"]
