		{
			title: "终于有炼金术了"
			x: -9.5d
			y: -4.5d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7将所有部分整合起来的最终机器是 Alchemiter。它体积相当大，但我觉得完全值得占用空间。"
				""
				"&7使用炼金术士很简单。平台旁边有一个高高的手臂。手臂底部附近有一个平台，上面有类似图腾车床的棋盘格。将塑形好的克鲁克斯石木棍右键点击到这个平台上。"
				""
				"&7现在你可以右键点击 Alchemiter 平台本身，查看制作刻在 Dowel 上的物品所需的成本，并设置你想要制作的数量。"
				""
				"&7To make items, you'll need to collect a resource called Grist, which comes in a variety of types. While you start with 20 Build Grist, the most common type... getting more might be a little more difficult..."
			]
			dependencies: ["415FC4F6B22EA0F7"]
			id: "10E2B9F70E803BDB"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7BC7BBD0B4D1BA52"
				type: "item"
				item: "minestuck:alchemiter"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "10E83500EF2C7681"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "一个装饰齐全的背包"
			x: -7.0d
			y: -5.75d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7行啦，强盗，那张空白磁盘是炼金术的第一步，或者说是SBurb……我的意思是Minestuck……所谓的炼金术。它主要涉及使用4台机器和……嗯……"
				""
				"&7...在理解炼金术之前，我需要先教你 Minestuck 特有的物品栏系统——Sylladex。"
				""
				"&7要访问你的Sylladex，按G键。别担心其他标签页，我们现在先关注最左边的Captchalogue Deck。这是Sylladex的核心。点击Sylladex按钮吧。"
				""
				"&7Unless you somehow added Cards here, this should be empty, unfortunately. But we can easily fix that. Craft up some Captchalogue Cards, and put them in the slot next to the Sylladex button, then hit Use Item to add them to your Captchalogue Deck!"
			]
			dependencies: ["1FCB0E4A2F267C82"]
			id: "679B9480C543F403"
			tasks: [{
				id: "09894FCD2FC3A9D8"
