				"&7Transportalizer 是一种能将你传送到另一个 Transportalizer 的机器。"
				""
				"&7When you place one down, it generates a random 4 character code. When you Right Click the Transportalizer, you can see that one's code, as well as a space to put in another Transportalizer's code."
				""
				"&7输入另一个Transportalizer代码后，你就可以用机器传送到那里了。"
				""
